WEBVTT

02:26.480 --> 02:26.960
Zhu.

02:27.840 --> 02:28.440
Did you hear?

02:29.120 --> 02:29.840
Your ex-wife

02:30.079 --> 02:31.000
and Xing Wu's mom

02:31.000 --> 02:32.200
ended up at the police station.

02:32.800 --> 02:34.320
What? They went to the station?

02:34.600 --> 02:35.320
How is that possible?

02:35.360 --> 02:36.520
Don't listen to gossip.

02:37.120 --> 02:38.480
Ask around if you don't believe me.

02:38.600 --> 02:39.120
Listen,

02:39.120 --> 02:39.920
you finally found

02:39.920 --> 02:41.280
a bright student like Qing Ye.

02:41.440 --> 02:42.480
Don't let

02:42.480 --> 02:44.000
family trouble drag her down.

02:44.640 --> 02:46.120
Otherwise, she may end up

02:46.320 --> 02:47.200
just like Xing Wu.

02:55.920 --> 02:58.120
Why's the sign broken?

02:58.160 --> 02:59.680
It was fine yesterday.

03:00.720 --> 03:01.760
When bad luck hits,

03:01.800 --> 03:02.920
it all hits at once.

03:03.160 --> 03:03.800
Just my luck.

03:05.880 --> 03:06.680
What's going on?

03:06.960 --> 03:07.800
A power outage?

03:08.640 --> 03:09.720
Probably a loose connection.

03:10.720 --> 03:11.600
I'll fix it later.

03:12.160 --> 03:13.360
How is Grandma now?

03:14.200 --> 03:15.400
Grandma's in the hospital now.

03:15.760 --> 03:17.079
Shu Han's with her now.

03:20.120 --> 03:20.720
Don't worry.

03:20.760 --> 03:21.200
Lanfang.

03:21.200 --> 03:21.640
It's okay.

03:22.760 --> 03:23.480
You're back.

03:24.120 --> 03:25.160
What happened, exactly?

03:27.360 --> 03:28.600
Let's talk at the mahjong parlor.

03:28.800 --> 03:29.480
Come on, let's go.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.040
We'll talk there.

03:31.079 --> 03:31.720
Are you okay?

03:31.800 --> 03:33.320
What could possibly be wrong?

03:33.880 --> 03:35.320
Shu Han is with Grandma.

03:37.000 --> 03:38.079
Quanya and Shu Han

03:38.280 --> 03:39.200
will take turns tonight.

03:39.400 --> 03:40.640
I'll bring some things tomorrow.

03:42.200 --> 03:43.720
The surgery must be expensive.

03:44.480 --> 03:45.560
Is there anything I can do?

03:46.960 --> 03:48.200
Don't worry about that.

03:48.400 --> 03:49.280
You're a student.

03:49.520 --> 03:50.600
Just focus on studying.

04:36.920 --> 04:37.680
Why are you back?

04:40.320 --> 04:41.680
Grandma's more important.

04:42.080 --> 04:43.159
I just came to check on you.

04:43.159 --> 04:44.440
Do you need any help?

04:45.120 --> 04:45.640
I'm fine.

04:45.960 --> 04:46.640
I've got this.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.840
Can you stop trying to

04:50.840 --> 04:52.080
shoulder everything yourself?

04:53.440 --> 04:56.600
Your mom may seem carefree,

04:57.280 --> 04:58.480
but that's because

04:58.520 --> 05:00.880
I'm just giving myself an out.

05:06.800 --> 05:07.640
Grandma's treatment

05:08.520 --> 05:09.600
may be over 10,000 yuan.

05:12.520 --> 05:13.080
I know.

05:13.760 --> 05:14.640
I'll figure it out.

05:17.920 --> 05:18.840
I'll figure something out too.

05:42.600 --> 05:43.120
Yufen.

05:43.440 --> 05:44.000
[Lanfang.]

05:44.280 --> 05:45.600
[Why did you leave so suddenly?]

05:45.880 --> 05:47.400
[We know things are hard for you.]

05:47.760 --> 05:48.640
[Don't be embarrassed.]

05:48.640 --> 05:49.600
[Ask us if you need money.]

05:49.840 --> 05:50.720
[When you came to the shop,]

05:50.920 --> 05:52.280
[we could all tell.]

05:53.840 --> 05:55.200
Well,

05:55.600 --> 05:56.159
I...

05:57.000 --> 05:58.280
[Cici and I talked it over.]

05:58.600 --> 05:59.240
[Cici and I can pool]

05:59.240 --> 06:00.240
[six thousand yuan first.]

06:00.680 --> 06:02.080
[The neighbors will]

06:02.160 --> 06:03.200
[help figure out the rest.]

06:03.360 --> 06:04.720
[Don't stress about it, okay?]

06:09.320 --> 06:10.080
You know me.

06:10.360 --> 06:12.040
I always stay optimistic.

06:25.920 --> 06:26.600
Hello, Dahei.

06:26.960 --> 06:29.600
It's me. I need a favor.

06:31.840 --> 06:32.760
Here's the thing.

06:33.800 --> 06:35.200
Something happened to Grandma.

06:35.960 --> 06:36.480
She's in the hospital.

06:38.040 --> 06:40.000
I'm short on money.

06:40.600 --> 06:42.320
Could you

06:42.840 --> 06:44.159
lend me five thousand?

06:44.600 --> 06:45.680
If not, three thousand.

06:45.880 --> 06:46.680
Two thousand is fine too.

06:50.480 --> 06:50.960
Sure, sure.

06:50.960 --> 06:51.720
No problem.

06:54.400 --> 06:55.000
Okay, okay.

06:55.880 --> 06:56.720
Thanks. Thank you.

06:57.200 --> 06:57.920
I appreciate it.

07:14.040 --> 07:14.680
[Qing Ye.]

07:15.120 --> 07:16.160
[Help me with English.]

07:16.640 --> 07:17.480
[I can pay you.]

07:27.160 --> 07:27.880
Hello, Qing Ye.

07:29.240 --> 07:29.680
Hello?

07:30.040 --> 07:31.880
About the English tutoring,

07:32.159 --> 07:33.640
still 300 yuan a lesson?

07:33.760 --> 07:34.600
Does that still stand?

07:35.040 --> 07:36.000
Of course.

07:36.800 --> 07:37.960
Okay. I accept.

07:38.159 --> 07:39.040
I have conditions too.

07:39.760 --> 07:40.480
Name them.

07:42.280 --> 07:43.400
Pay a deposit first.

07:43.960 --> 07:45.360
Ten lessons minimum.

07:45.600 --> 07:47.320
Book ten, get one free.

07:47.880 --> 07:49.080
I pick the time and place.

07:49.960 --> 07:50.600
No problem.

07:51.040 --> 07:52.280
Make it twenty lessons.

07:55.360 --> 07:55.800
Okay.

08:23.960 --> 08:25.200
Morning, Qing Ye.

08:25.360 --> 08:26.000
Shu Han.

08:26.160 --> 08:26.600
Get in.

08:26.680 --> 08:28.080
Wait. Didn't we say evenings?

08:28.080 --> 08:29.360
Why are you here now?

08:29.800 --> 08:31.000
Shu Han said it's on her way.

08:31.080 --> 08:32.120
She's taking us to school.

08:34.120 --> 08:35.080
Since I'm picking you up,

08:35.480 --> 08:36.520
I'll drop them at school

08:36.640 --> 08:37.400
then head to the county.

08:38.760 --> 08:39.200
Let's go.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.520
I sent you the new contract.

08:41.640 --> 08:42.679
I changed it

08:42.679 --> 08:43.520
as you asked.

08:43.520 --> 08:44.120
When you have time,

08:44.120 --> 08:44.960
read it carefully.

08:45.760 --> 08:46.520
Mr. Ye is

08:46.520 --> 08:47.840
really sincere this time.

08:47.960 --> 08:49.000
He wants to offer you

08:49.000 --> 08:49.920
a three-year full-time contract.

08:50.240 --> 08:51.120
Think it over.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.160
I've read the contract.

08:52.240 --> 08:53.040
No issues.

08:53.120 --> 08:54.400
Print it and start the paperwork.

08:54.440 --> 08:54.840
Okay.

08:55.640 --> 08:56.160
Qing Ye.

08:56.520 --> 08:57.360
I have a contract too.

08:59.000 --> 09:00.800
I thought it over last night.

09:01.600 --> 09:02.960
I think we should make

09:03.520 --> 09:04.680
our relationship official.

09:05.120 --> 09:05.760
What relationship?

09:08.880 --> 09:09.880
A teacher-student relationship.

09:11.600 --> 09:12.640
And the contract proves it.

09:12.960 --> 09:13.960
Those twenty lessons,

09:14.160 --> 09:15.600
you can't skip a single one.

09:15.960 --> 09:17.240
Not even the two freebies.

09:18.040 --> 09:18.800
No refunds either.

09:20.400 --> 09:21.520
You're tutoring him?

09:23.240 --> 09:24.000
Since when?

09:25.080 --> 09:26.040
We agreed last night.

09:26.600 --> 09:27.440
We start today.

09:28.080 --> 09:28.600
Xing Wu.

09:28.880 --> 09:29.480
Look,

09:29.880 --> 09:30.840
You and Shu Han

09:30.840 --> 09:31.840
both work for my dad.

09:32.520 --> 09:34.560
I'm a VIP at Xuan Island too.

09:34.640 --> 09:36.400
And Qing Ye is my teacher now.

09:36.760 --> 09:37.360
Guess I'm really meant

09:37.360 --> 09:38.480
to be part of

09:38.840 --> 09:40.160
your Xuan Island family.

09:41.840 --> 09:42.920
Get in already.

09:45.600 --> 09:46.040
Coming.

10:09.240 --> 10:10.880
Ye Yingjian, hurry up.

10:10.920 --> 10:11.720
Almost. Wait for me.

10:12.160 --> 10:13.360
Qing Ye, remember to sign it.

10:20.000 --> 10:20.480
Qing Ye.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.320
Ye Yingjian's contract.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.640
Do you have to?

10:28.680 --> 10:30.160
Then Shu Han's contract,

10:30.640 --> 10:31.480
Do you have to?

10:41.520 --> 10:42.280
Your job here

10:42.280 --> 10:43.040
is to study hard

10:43.040 --> 10:44.280
and leave after the gaokao.

10:45.280 --> 10:46.640
Tutoring is just extra.

10:47.040 --> 10:48.120
It won't affect my studies.

10:50.200 --> 10:51.280
I know you're trying

10:51.680 --> 10:52.400
to help Grandma.

10:52.640 --> 10:53.080
Exactly.

10:53.880 --> 10:54.520
You know

10:55.120 --> 10:56.440
I can't just stand by.

10:56.480 --> 10:57.320
But my family's problems

10:57.320 --> 10:58.400
can't be solved

10:58.400 --> 10:59.200
with a few thousand yuan.

11:06.040 --> 11:06.960
In a week,

11:07.360 --> 11:08.480
my enrollment will be canceled.

11:08.880 --> 11:09.640
Tell Zhu Feng

11:09.760 --> 11:10.560
to cancel it.

11:12.360 --> 11:13.760
You're really not going back?

11:16.280 --> 11:16.840
I'm not.

12:09.840 --> 12:10.440
Liu Nian.

12:11.080 --> 12:11.520
Lanfang.

12:14.240 --> 12:15.040
This is an IOU.

12:15.760 --> 12:16.400
Take it.

12:16.800 --> 12:18.440
I'll pay back every cent.

12:19.160 --> 12:21.000
For now, ask your friends

12:21.040 --> 12:21.880
about some odd jobs.

12:22.200 --> 12:23.240
When we reopen,

12:23.240 --> 12:24.120
I'll let you know.

12:25.360 --> 12:25.840
Lanfang,

12:26.160 --> 12:27.280
I haven't worked these days.

12:27.520 --> 12:28.360
Can you deduct

12:28.360 --> 12:28.920
those days?

12:30.720 --> 12:32.120
You won't lose a cent of your pay.

12:32.480 --> 12:33.280
Take it. Don't worry.

12:33.880 --> 12:34.880
I have money.

12:36.320 --> 12:36.960
Then, Lanfang,

12:37.320 --> 12:38.880
when can we reopen?

12:41.440 --> 12:42.200
I believe

12:43.600 --> 12:44.600
it'll be very soon.

13:01.360 --> 13:02.080
Who is it?

13:03.480 --> 13:04.120
Coming.

13:07.000 --> 13:07.560
Xiaolian.

13:09.040 --> 13:10.840
It's me. I came to see you.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.560
Open the door. Let me in.

13:12.840 --> 13:13.320
Xiaolian.

13:13.600 --> 13:14.520
Xiaolian, I really came

13:14.520 --> 13:15.680
to apologize

13:15.680 --> 13:17.160
and make things right.

13:22.160 --> 13:22.600
Well,

13:23.000 --> 13:24.200
Xiaolian, I'll go now.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.880
I brought you some food.

13:27.120 --> 13:28.200
I'll leave it at the door.

13:28.680 --> 13:30.400
Remember to eat it.

13:39.720 --> 13:40.400
Xiaolian.

13:41.120 --> 13:41.880
Xiaolian.

13:43.680 --> 13:44.760
Xiaolian, Xia...

13:46.320 --> 13:47.200
Xiaolian.

13:47.520 --> 13:47.920
This...

13:52.720 --> 13:54.600
I paid good money for this.

14:20.000 --> 14:21.400
Pass out the papers.

14:21.600 --> 14:22.200
Mr. Zhu.

14:23.000 --> 14:24.200
Can you sign this for me?

14:27.440 --> 14:28.000
A leave slip?

14:28.440 --> 14:28.840
Yes.

14:29.200 --> 14:30.320
I'd like to ask

14:30.360 --> 14:31.720
to miss evening study this week.

14:32.040 --> 14:33.200
Grandma's in the hospital.

14:34.080 --> 14:35.160
I need to stay with her.

14:35.520 --> 14:36.280
But I promise

14:36.280 --> 14:37.120
I won't fall behind.

14:37.800 --> 14:38.240
Okay.

14:42.760 --> 14:43.480
Thank you, Mr. Zhu.

14:44.600 --> 14:45.200
Right, Qing Ye.

14:49.240 --> 14:51.360
About what I told you last time,

14:51.880 --> 14:53.080
how did your talk with Xing Wu go?

14:55.520 --> 14:56.600
Grandma needs care.

14:56.840 --> 14:57.840
Xuan Island has to fix issues.

14:58.760 --> 15:00.000
Everything at home is a mess.

15:02.960 --> 15:03.440
Got it.

15:03.920 --> 15:04.440
Okay. Go ahead.

15:37.760 --> 15:38.520
Wu.

15:39.480 --> 15:40.320
Take a break.

15:41.320 --> 15:42.640
Grandma can rest now.

15:43.760 --> 15:44.280
Go to sleep.

15:57.240 --> 15:58.440
[Your enrollment's canceled.]

15:59.440 --> 16:01.000
[Doesn't that feel like a waste?]

17:01.080 --> 17:01.640
Qing Ye.

17:02.320 --> 17:03.080
Why did you leave?

17:03.480 --> 17:04.359
Skipping evening study?

17:05.440 --> 17:06.160
I got permission.

17:06.680 --> 17:07.319
Leave?

17:08.240 --> 17:09.079
Did something happen?

17:10.760 --> 17:11.400
Not really.

17:13.680 --> 17:15.079
You suddenly want to tutor me

17:16.280 --> 17:17.480
because I'm already good,

17:17.760 --> 17:18.680
so I can get even better,

17:19.160 --> 17:19.960
so we can both

17:19.960 --> 17:21.200
get into good colleges together?

17:26.319 --> 17:27.440
You're still unhappy.

17:28.160 --> 17:29.280
Are you short of money?

17:31.080 --> 17:31.800
Is there anything

17:31.800 --> 17:32.920
money can't solve?

17:41.160 --> 17:42.400
You think the same as I used to.

17:43.520 --> 17:44.600
But lately, life

17:44.600 --> 17:45.440
has taught me

17:46.640 --> 17:47.600
that some problems

17:48.400 --> 17:49.760
money just can't fix.

17:52.120 --> 17:53.080
There are things

17:53.080 --> 17:54.080
money can't fix?

18:00.480 --> 18:02.080
I used to be confused

18:03.000 --> 18:04.320
why he couldn't choose

18:04.320 --> 18:06.080
his own life and fate.

18:07.480 --> 18:08.600
Later, I put myself

18:08.600 --> 18:09.240
in his shoes.

18:10.120 --> 18:10.960
If I were him,

18:11.960 --> 18:13.000
would I do any better?

18:15.400 --> 18:17.000
Maybe I'd make the same choice.

18:19.120 --> 18:19.640
He?

18:20.440 --> 18:21.120
Who's he?

18:24.680 --> 18:25.480
Someone in my family.

18:26.680 --> 18:27.600
Family?

18:28.680 --> 18:29.760
I don't know how to comfort you.

18:30.760 --> 18:31.360
And I don't know

18:31.360 --> 18:32.640
how to help your family.

18:33.160 --> 18:34.080
But I know

18:34.520 --> 18:35.680
if it were me,

18:37.160 --> 18:38.400
I'd stay by her side,

18:39.840 --> 18:40.960
even if I could do nothing.

18:46.320 --> 18:47.720
Thank you for telling me.

18:49.280 --> 18:50.000
I'll go now.

19:33.880 --> 19:34.480
Grandma.

19:34.520 --> 19:35.400
Ye.

19:35.920 --> 19:36.720
You're here.

19:37.360 --> 19:37.720
Better?

19:37.720 --> 19:38.400
Did you get wet?

19:38.800 --> 19:39.880
I'm fine. I'm fine.

19:41.080 --> 19:42.040
How are you feeling?

19:42.440 --> 19:43.280
Good.

19:43.640 --> 19:44.240
Wu

19:44.560 --> 19:46.080
has taken care of me every day.

19:46.640 --> 19:47.720
I'm recovering very well.

19:48.640 --> 19:49.600
That's good.

19:50.040 --> 19:51.440
I brought you fish soup.

19:51.640 --> 19:53.040
Have more later.

19:53.200 --> 19:53.840
Get some calcium.

19:53.960 --> 19:54.800
It helps you heal.

19:55.200 --> 19:55.720
Okay.

19:56.240 --> 19:56.960
All right.

19:57.120 --> 19:57.600
Good.

20:00.400 --> 20:00.800
Here.

20:01.920 --> 20:02.520
Okay, here.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.960
Hot fish soup.

20:11.520 --> 20:12.200
Here, try it.

20:12.440 --> 20:12.920
Okay.

20:13.000 --> 20:13.520
Taste okay?

20:18.520 --> 20:19.280
Delicious.

20:21.680 --> 20:23.680
Lanfang made this, right?

20:25.480 --> 20:26.480
How did you know?

20:27.200 --> 20:29.480
I've eaten her cooking for decades.

20:29.640 --> 20:30.560
How could I not know?

20:32.600 --> 20:33.160
Look.

20:34.040 --> 20:35.600
When she makes fish soup,

20:36.040 --> 20:38.000
there's not a single fishbone.

20:43.400 --> 20:43.960
Grandma.

20:45.200 --> 20:46.640
Auntie asked me to tell you

20:47.200 --> 20:49.040
after she deals with He Xiaolian,

20:49.320 --> 20:50.240
she'll come to you.

20:51.200 --> 20:51.800
Okay.

20:54.880 --> 20:55.800
Drink it while it's warm.

23:07.280 --> 23:07.680
Here.

23:08.440 --> 23:09.120
I'm sorry.

23:09.840 --> 23:10.720
Xing Wu's mom, why are you here?

23:11.480 --> 23:11.880
I...

23:12.880 --> 23:13.840
I came to bring you soup.

23:14.880 --> 23:16.200
Look, it's noon.

23:16.200 --> 23:17.720
Why are you still eating instant noodles?

23:17.960 --> 23:19.840
You do so much for your students.

23:20.040 --> 23:21.280
Have some soup.

23:21.560 --> 23:23.000
It smells good.

23:24.120 --> 23:24.800
You drink it.

23:26.160 --> 23:27.040
You need something, right?

23:28.880 --> 23:30.720
Yes. I need your help.

23:32.000 --> 23:33.280
I can guess

23:33.280 --> 23:33.840
what it is.

23:36.080 --> 23:36.600
Well...

23:37.920 --> 23:39.720
Xiaolian keeps avoiding me,

23:40.080 --> 23:41.280
but I really need

23:41.320 --> 23:42.080
to see her, just once.

23:42.560 --> 23:44.120
so I came to ask for help.

23:44.120 --> 23:44.760
No problem.

23:45.360 --> 23:46.480
He Xiaolian and I

23:46.480 --> 23:47.880
lived together for years.

23:47.880 --> 23:48.800
Her temper, her ways,

23:48.800 --> 23:49.520
I know them best.

23:50.240 --> 23:50.920
How about this?

23:51.120 --> 23:52.080
I'll go with you.

23:52.600 --> 23:53.720
You'll come with me?

23:54.920 --> 23:55.640
It's fine.

23:55.760 --> 23:56.960
Thank you, Mr. Zhu.

23:57.160 --> 23:57.640
Thank you.

23:57.720 --> 23:58.120
It's fine.

23:58.720 --> 23:59.320
Think of it

23:59.640 --> 24:00.320
for Xing Wu's sake.

24:08.720 --> 24:09.640
Xiaolian is home.

24:10.600 --> 24:11.200
Xiaolian.

24:12.640 --> 24:13.160
Xiaolian.

24:13.200 --> 24:14.360
Xia... Xiaolian. Xiaolian.

24:14.360 --> 24:14.800
Xiaolian.

24:15.160 --> 24:15.760
Let go.

24:15.840 --> 24:16.360
Xiaolian.

24:16.760 --> 24:17.640
We need to talk.

24:18.000 --> 24:18.640
Li Lanfang,

24:18.840 --> 24:20.640
my student Xing Wu's mother.

24:21.000 --> 24:21.600
Xiaolian.

24:22.080 --> 24:22.880
I'm sorry.

24:23.320 --> 24:23.760
Well...

24:24.240 --> 24:25.920
I came to bring you money.

24:27.000 --> 24:27.800
That's all?

24:28.080 --> 24:28.880
Not 30,000?

24:30.760 --> 24:32.120
It isn't thirty thousand.

24:33.120 --> 24:35.520
Your medical bill was 1,500 yuan.

24:35.720 --> 24:36.960
The rest is yours

24:37.080 --> 24:37.920
to spend as you like.

24:37.920 --> 24:38.800
Go ahead.

24:38.960 --> 24:40.520
We agreed on thirty thousand.

24:40.800 --> 24:41.440
Xiaolian.

24:42.760 --> 24:44.680
I scraped this money together

24:44.680 --> 24:45.360
from everywhere.

24:45.880 --> 24:48.000
My shop is closed.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.000
And my mother-in-law

24:49.000 --> 24:50.200
fell ill and is in the hospital.

24:50.560 --> 24:51.720
She needs money too.

24:52.520 --> 24:55.080
My family can't offer any more.

24:55.400 --> 24:57.200
We can't pay thirty thousand.

24:57.960 --> 24:59.360
None of this is easy.

24:59.760 --> 25:00.320
Besides,

25:00.800 --> 25:02.520
Your allergy looks nearly gone.

25:02.600 --> 25:04.000
Your tattooed brows look nice too.

25:04.080 --> 25:04.480
You'll be fine.

25:04.480 --> 25:05.320
Mind your own business.

25:06.680 --> 25:07.240
Li Lanfang.

25:08.120 --> 25:09.080
If you can't pay 30,000,

25:09.080 --> 25:10.160
we're done talking.

25:10.280 --> 25:10.720
Leave.

25:10.880 --> 25:11.400
Xiaolian.

25:11.400 --> 25:12.440
I'm begging you.

25:12.520 --> 25:14.320
Take this for now.

25:14.600 --> 25:16.040
Don't waste your breath.

25:16.040 --> 25:16.480
Go.

25:16.480 --> 25:17.600
I'll do whatever you ask.

25:17.800 --> 25:18.640
I'll kneel.

25:19.040 --> 25:19.920
I'll kneel.

25:20.120 --> 25:20.640
You...

25:20.720 --> 25:22.440
I... I'm sorry, Xiaolian.

25:22.760 --> 25:23.240
Li Lanfang.

25:23.240 --> 25:23.920
Come on, get up.

25:24.120 --> 25:24.720
He Xiaolian.

25:25.160 --> 25:26.080
What are you doing?

25:26.160 --> 25:26.920
Zhu Feng.

25:43.080 --> 25:44.800
That's enough.

25:57.360 --> 25:57.840
Fine.

25:59.280 --> 26:00.240
Let's leave it at that.

26:02.000 --> 26:02.720
Come on. It's okay now.

26:02.920 --> 26:03.360
Come on.

26:05.200 --> 26:06.320
That's settled.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.000
Settled.

26:23.720 --> 26:24.440
Here, Xing Wu's mom.

26:24.880 --> 26:25.600
Mr. Zhu, it's so hot.

26:25.600 --> 26:26.320
Have some milk tea.

26:26.480 --> 26:27.240
Thank you.

26:30.800 --> 26:32.280
My students love this.

26:33.200 --> 26:33.760
It's good.

26:34.560 --> 26:35.120
Mr. Zhu.

26:36.280 --> 26:36.720
I...

26:37.640 --> 26:38.320
I need to thank you.

26:38.880 --> 26:40.280
You mean back there?

26:42.280 --> 26:43.400
I could've

26:43.440 --> 26:44.840
knelt alone.

26:45.160 --> 26:47.160
But you got scolded too.

26:47.240 --> 26:47.680
You really...

26:47.920 --> 26:49.600
It's settled. That's what matters.

26:49.880 --> 26:50.640
I don't mind.

26:51.360 --> 26:52.040
You don't know yet.

26:52.040 --> 26:53.440
It's not my first

26:53.640 --> 26:54.600
kneeling before Xiaolian.

26:58.600 --> 26:59.600
Xiaolian, you know,

27:00.000 --> 27:00.760
isn't a bad person.

27:01.080 --> 27:02.920
She just has a fierce temper.

27:03.360 --> 27:04.440
And I'm too soft.

27:04.600 --> 27:06.280
She always says, Zhu Feng,

27:06.520 --> 27:07.360
as a grown man,

27:07.360 --> 27:08.760
why are you always so meek?

27:08.920 --> 27:10.280
A man should show some backbone.

27:10.360 --> 27:11.080
Don't I know that?

27:11.760 --> 27:13.320
Of course I do.

27:14.360 --> 27:15.480
The thing is,

27:16.000 --> 27:16.680
at home,

27:16.680 --> 27:17.200
it's not about

27:17.200 --> 27:18.320
who's right.

27:19.040 --> 27:20.080
When life gets real,

27:20.360 --> 27:21.320
I know when to bend.

27:22.160 --> 27:22.720
My dreams?

27:23.000 --> 27:23.680
No place for them.

27:24.840 --> 27:26.680
Apologizing isn't giving in.

27:26.880 --> 27:28.760
It's winning by yielding.

27:29.280 --> 27:30.200
But

27:30.240 --> 27:31.520
He Xiaolian is too tough.

27:31.600 --> 27:32.360
I was no match for her.

27:33.440 --> 27:34.120
Mr. Zhu.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.400
Somehow, everything

27:35.400 --> 27:36.200
you say

27:36.200 --> 27:37.760
sounds reasonable.

27:37.840 --> 27:38.280
Yes.

27:38.600 --> 27:39.880
That's what teachers do.

27:41.040 --> 27:42.040
Actually, Xing Wu's mom,

27:42.400 --> 27:43.480
I really admire you.

27:44.960 --> 27:45.640
Admire me?

27:47.200 --> 27:48.000
Look at the mess

27:48.040 --> 27:48.880
I've made of my life.

27:48.880 --> 27:49.800
What's there to admire?

27:51.480 --> 27:53.480
Ever heard of trigonometric functions?

27:54.840 --> 27:55.360
What?

27:56.640 --> 27:58.600
Trig functions.

27:58.600 --> 27:59.920
They move in cycles,

27:59.920 --> 28:00.880
with a certain rhythm.

28:01.160 --> 28:02.400
Peaks and valleys

28:02.440 --> 28:03.600
take turns.

28:04.320 --> 28:05.600
Life is a little like that.

28:06.160 --> 28:06.640
Look at you.

28:06.680 --> 28:07.720
Right now, maybe

28:07.720 --> 28:08.960
you're at a low point.

28:09.960 --> 28:10.680
But I believe

28:11.200 --> 28:12.200
as long as you

28:12.240 --> 28:13.840
keep going with hope,

28:14.640 --> 28:15.880
you'll come out of it

28:15.880 --> 28:16.840
and get back

28:16.920 --> 28:18.280
on an upward curve.

28:19.080 --> 28:20.360
Mr. Zhu, I get it.

28:20.600 --> 28:21.480
You mean

28:21.480 --> 28:23.160
my luck may turn soon.

28:24.000 --> 28:24.760
More or less.

28:25.640 --> 28:27.120
Hope your words come true.

28:27.560 --> 28:27.920
Well...

28:29.320 --> 28:31.200
Sea Goddess, bless me.

28:31.200 --> 28:32.560
Bless me, Li Lanfang.

28:32.600 --> 28:34.120
Please turn my luck around.

28:35.640 --> 28:36.200
Mr. Zhu.

28:36.520 --> 28:37.400
When you come by,

28:37.480 --> 28:38.680
I'll do your hair for free.

28:39.600 --> 28:40.400
That wouldn't be right.

28:40.440 --> 28:41.040
You've had it hard too.

28:41.520 --> 28:43.080
If you really want to thank me,

28:44.000 --> 28:44.480
then do this.

28:44.760 --> 28:45.960
Have Xing Wu thank me at school.

28:49.600 --> 28:50.920
The way Wu is now

28:51.400 --> 28:52.080
is my fault

28:52.120 --> 28:53.000
as his mother.

28:53.400 --> 28:54.360
Don't say that.

28:55.080 --> 28:56.400
Xing Wu is a good kid.

28:57.440 --> 28:58.080
I just think

28:58.080 --> 28:59.040
it's a shame if he quits school.

29:00.000 --> 29:01.200
A child's future

29:01.200 --> 29:01.720
can't be ruined

29:01.720 --> 29:03.240
by adult problems.

29:03.920 --> 29:04.600
Don't you agree?

29:06.720 --> 29:07.240
Yes.

29:12.640 --> 29:14.360
Since I'm helping,

29:14.400 --> 29:15.840
let me help all the way.

29:16.480 --> 29:16.920
Sure.

29:17.440 --> 29:17.880
Careful.

29:18.120 --> 29:18.520
Okay.

29:21.640 --> 29:22.320
Xing Wu's mom.

29:23.040 --> 29:23.920
This next song

29:23.920 --> 29:24.720
is for you.

29:25.480 --> 29:25.920
Great.

29:59.920 --> 30:00.680
I'm back.

30:00.960 --> 30:01.640
You're back.

30:03.880 --> 30:04.840
Zhu told me

30:05.320 --> 30:06.760
you settled the compensation.

30:08.840 --> 30:09.800
He told you that?

30:12.120 --> 30:14.080
Why does he tell you

30:14.160 --> 30:15.360
all my embarrassing stories?

30:15.480 --> 30:16.360
Embarrassing?

30:18.880 --> 30:20.040
How did he say it?

30:22.600 --> 30:23.240
He said

30:23.800 --> 30:25.360
you were a rose of steel,

30:26.760 --> 30:28.600
turning back the tide

30:28.640 --> 30:30.080
and bracing a crumbling mansion.

30:33.440 --> 30:34.840
I only got the first half.

30:35.480 --> 30:36.360
Well...

30:36.480 --> 30:37.920
the second half is right too.

30:39.920 --> 30:40.320
By the way,

30:40.440 --> 30:41.320
Grandma gets out

30:41.800 --> 30:42.840
this weekend, right?

30:43.840 --> 30:45.000
The doctor says she's doing well.

30:45.160 --> 30:45.640
This weekend,

30:45.640 --> 30:46.640
she can rest at home.

30:47.040 --> 30:47.600
That's great.

30:47.960 --> 30:48.880
I've been busy lately

30:48.880 --> 30:49.800
getting the permit.

30:50.160 --> 30:51.320
I'll get her room

30:51.320 --> 30:51.960
ready in a bit.

30:52.080 --> 30:52.680
I'll do it.

30:53.120 --> 30:53.600
Also,

30:53.720 --> 30:55.440
I ordered a new

30:55.600 --> 30:56.200
roll-up banner.

30:56.480 --> 30:57.880
We're reopening soon, right?

30:57.920 --> 30:58.680
When you have time,

30:58.680 --> 31:00.000
pick it up for me.

31:00.520 --> 31:00.880
Okay.

31:10.000 --> 31:10.440
Coming.

31:11.120 --> 31:11.600
Coming.

31:20.360 --> 31:21.320
She's back home.

31:21.520 --> 31:22.000
Wu.

31:23.600 --> 31:24.120
Mom.

31:24.720 --> 31:25.520
Careful. Careful.

31:26.120 --> 31:27.200
Careful, Mom. Don't rush.

31:27.720 --> 31:28.400
You're back.

31:29.120 --> 31:29.520
Careful.

31:29.600 --> 31:29.960
Careful.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.400
Thank you, sir.

31:32.840 --> 31:33.320
Ye.

31:34.160 --> 31:35.120
Okay, thanks. We're home.

31:35.400 --> 31:36.080
Mom. Mom.

31:36.120 --> 31:37.040
Lanfang.

31:37.040 --> 31:37.520
Mom.

31:37.720 --> 31:38.280
How are you?

31:38.520 --> 31:39.240
You okay?

31:39.400 --> 31:40.040
Good.

31:40.600 --> 31:41.360
Listen,

31:41.600 --> 31:43.240
everything is settled now.

31:43.880 --> 31:45.120
The business license too.

31:45.280 --> 31:45.640
Look.

31:45.840 --> 31:46.800
We've even put up

31:46.840 --> 31:48.360
the reopening sign.

31:49.400 --> 31:50.400
That's wonderful.

31:51.040 --> 31:52.520
No more foolish mistakes.

31:52.640 --> 31:53.480
No, no.

31:53.480 --> 31:54.200
Never again.

31:55.880 --> 31:56.280
Then...

31:56.520 --> 31:57.600
let's take a photo.

31:57.680 --> 31:58.200
Sure. Good.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.040
As a keepsake.

31:59.240 --> 31:59.760
Okay, Grandma.

31:59.760 --> 32:00.160
Okay.

32:00.280 --> 32:00.680
Come on.

32:00.760 --> 32:02.040
Everyone, get ready.

32:02.040 --> 32:03.600
I'll count down. Three, two, one.

32:03.800 --> 32:04.600
Okay, okay.

32:04.600 --> 32:06.800
Three, two, one.

32:07.080 --> 32:08.680
Cheese.

32:08.680 --> 32:09.400
One more.

32:10.320 --> 32:12.520
Three, two, one.

32:12.600 --> 32:14.280
Cheese.

32:15.200 --> 32:16.440
Check it. Is it straight?

32:17.640 --> 32:18.080
Crooked.

32:18.200 --> 32:19.400
No, it's crooked.

32:19.640 --> 32:20.960
Wait. Is it straight?

32:21.440 --> 32:22.920
It's crooked, son.

32:23.600 --> 32:24.080
Is it straight?

32:24.760 --> 32:25.920
Just right.

32:26.000 --> 32:26.840
Good, good, good.

32:26.920 --> 32:27.320
Good.

32:27.840 --> 32:28.320
Grandma knows.

32:31.920 --> 32:32.600
This photo

32:32.800 --> 32:34.360
makes me feel at ease.

32:35.000 --> 32:35.840
The shop

32:35.880 --> 32:37.160
will only get better.

32:37.360 --> 32:39.240
When family stands united, all goes well.

32:39.840 --> 32:40.360
Exactly.

32:40.680 --> 32:41.200
Auntie.

32:41.680 --> 32:43.280
With that optimism,

32:43.600 --> 32:45.440
you can make anything work.

32:46.200 --> 32:46.720
Lanfang,

32:47.000 --> 32:47.760
I believe in you.

32:47.760 --> 32:48.880
You'll lead Xuan Island

32:48.960 --> 32:49.800
bigger and stronger.

32:50.040 --> 32:50.440
Good.

32:50.520 --> 32:51.160
Bigger, stronger.

32:51.240 --> 32:51.600
Yes.

32:51.720 --> 32:52.520
Bigger and stronger.

32:52.600 --> 32:53.600
Bigger and stronger!

32:53.640 --> 32:54.240
Good, good.

33:02.680 --> 33:03.120
Here.

33:07.600 --> 33:09.160
The weather changes so fast.

33:09.320 --> 33:10.680
It was sunny just now.

33:11.080 --> 33:12.080
Then it just started raining.

33:12.760 --> 33:13.880
Maybe life is like that.

33:14.600 --> 33:15.320
One second,

33:16.040 --> 33:16.800
the sky is clear.

33:17.160 --> 33:18.280
the next, a storm.

33:20.640 --> 33:21.600
So, Boss Xing,

33:21.800 --> 33:22.360
when do you plan

33:22.360 --> 33:23.280
to start at the county office?

33:25.520 --> 33:26.160
Not sure yet.

33:28.800 --> 33:30.200
Things got delayed because of Grandma.

33:32.200 --> 33:32.720
Wait.

33:35.040 --> 33:35.520
What?

33:36.920 --> 33:38.400
My Mom still trying to get me back to school?

33:42.640 --> 33:44.800
If taking the county job

33:45.640 --> 33:46.880
is the best choice

33:46.920 --> 33:47.920
you can make now,

33:48.920 --> 33:49.960
I won't object.

33:54.160 --> 33:54.880
No more school talk?

33:55.600 --> 33:56.080
No more.

33:56.760 --> 33:57.200
Why?

33:59.480 --> 34:00.480
Because I believe in you.

34:01.320 --> 34:02.400
Whichever road you take,

34:03.200 --> 34:04.880
even through a storm,

34:06.040 --> 34:06.720
you'll still reach

34:06.720 --> 34:07.720
your own Rome.

34:08.600 --> 34:09.480
And I promise,

34:10.239 --> 34:11.960
whatever decision you make,

34:12.600 --> 34:14.400
I'll stand by you all the way.

34:16.920 --> 34:17.440
Got it.

34:54.600 --> 34:55.760
What's with her?

34:55.960 --> 34:56.920
That's wild.

34:56.960 --> 34:57.440
Look.

34:59.640 --> 35:00.760
Wasn't her family poor?

35:01.040 --> 35:02.160
So she's a rich kid?

35:02.240 --> 35:03.840
And still had the nerve to claim aid?

35:03.920 --> 35:04.920
Her family has a criminal record.

35:05.320 --> 35:06.760
Can she still take civil service exams?

35:06.920 --> 35:08.680
Her dad can't explain all that money.

35:08.800 --> 35:09.880
She can't be clean either.

35:09.880 --> 35:10.600
Look. That's her.

35:11.200 --> 35:11.680
It's her.

35:13.880 --> 35:14.360
Qing Ye.

35:15.080 --> 35:15.520
Qing Ye.

35:16.360 --> 35:17.200
Something happened.

35:17.840 --> 35:18.400
What happened?

35:18.400 --> 35:19.680
Did you see the school forum?

35:20.200 --> 35:20.960
What post?

35:41.760 --> 35:42.400
Stop combing it.

35:42.400 --> 35:44.160
Combing only makes it look dog-chewed.

35:46.080 --> 35:47.600
A dog did get to it.

35:48.240 --> 35:48.800
Who cut it?

35:48.800 --> 35:49.520
I'll avoid it.

36:10.760 --> 36:12.520
Want some? Dried at home.

36:16.600 --> 36:17.440
Aren't you afraid of me?

36:17.840 --> 36:18.480
No.

36:19.040 --> 36:20.600
They believe every rumor.

36:20.840 --> 36:21.600
I don't.

36:35.280 --> 36:35.760
Shi Min.

36:36.640 --> 36:37.080
Qing Ye.

36:37.440 --> 36:37.800
Come.

36:38.120 --> 36:39.080
I saved you a seat. Hurry.

36:41.120 --> 36:41.600
Drumstick.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.120
What are you doing?

36:51.160 --> 36:52.440
Are you blind?

36:52.760 --> 36:54.200
Why bump into her on purpose?

36:54.480 --> 36:55.800
Sorry.

36:56.160 --> 36:57.000
Are you okay?

37:00.920 --> 37:02.120
Sorry.

37:03.120 --> 37:04.200
I didn't mean it either.

37:04.360 --> 37:05.000
It was an accident.

37:05.080 --> 37:06.000
Are you crazy?

37:06.000 --> 37:07.000
You did it on purpose.

37:07.040 --> 37:08.360
We didn't mean it.

37:08.520 --> 37:09.000
Qing Ye.

37:09.200 --> 37:10.040
You stained

37:10.080 --> 37:11.080
Li Wenhui's suit.

37:11.200 --> 37:12.400
Everyone saw it.

37:12.600 --> 37:13.600
Right?

37:13.880 --> 37:14.840
Yes.

37:14.880 --> 37:15.560
Bullshit.

37:15.600 --> 37:16.440
Forget it, Fang Lei.

37:16.520 --> 37:17.640
She's got thugs behind her.

37:17.720 --> 37:18.520
We can't mess with her.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.200
Got a problem? Come at me.

37:20.480 --> 37:21.680
Don't drag others in.

37:22.320 --> 37:23.360
Then you bullied

37:23.360 --> 37:24.640
Fang Lei and the others.

37:24.800 --> 37:25.600
What about that?

37:26.240 --> 37:26.760
Me?

37:27.160 --> 37:28.040
I bullied them?

37:28.960 --> 37:31.000
Zhu, Zhu, Zhu...

37:31.640 --> 37:32.080
Mr. Zhu.

37:32.120 --> 37:32.600
What's wrong?

37:32.840 --> 37:34.800
Qing Ye is in the cafeteria,

37:34.840 --> 37:36.840
fighting with someone.

37:37.000 --> 37:37.520
You cut

37:37.520 --> 37:38.640
both their hair

37:38.840 --> 37:39.760
and threatened them

37:39.880 --> 37:40.720
not to tell anyone.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.040
That's not bullying?

37:43.760 --> 37:44.280
Fang Lei.

37:44.400 --> 37:45.320
Am I lying?

37:46.680 --> 37:47.120
I...

37:47.240 --> 37:48.240
it's true.

37:48.480 --> 37:49.240
Look at Fang Lei's hair.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.440
Look what they did to it.

37:50.760 --> 37:52.000
You started it.

37:52.160 --> 37:52.760
When I'm bullied,

37:52.760 --> 37:54.080
I can't fight back?

37:55.200 --> 37:56.280
You scratched her hand, right?

37:56.480 --> 37:57.680
Isn't that bullying too?

37:58.120 --> 37:58.960
It was self-defense.

37:59.120 --> 37:59.960
Believe what you want.

38:00.680 --> 38:01.600
Stop right there.

38:02.760 --> 38:03.600
Fang Lei and Li Wenhui

38:03.600 --> 38:04.480
just want an apology.

38:04.600 --> 38:05.360
Is that too much?

38:06.080 --> 38:07.520
Just because you're from the city,

38:07.520 --> 38:08.680
you twist right and wrong around.

38:08.880 --> 38:10.240
We just want an apology.

38:10.960 --> 38:13.600
Say sorry! Apologize!

38:13.600 --> 38:14.120
Shut up.

38:14.120 --> 38:15.280
Say sorry to us.

38:15.360 --> 38:16.280
Shut up.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.120
Shut your mouths.

38:17.320 --> 38:20.480
Apologize now! Say sorry!

38:20.520 --> 38:21.600
Shut your mouths.

38:21.640 --> 38:23.040
Say sorry! Apologize!

38:23.040 --> 38:23.840
Shut up.

38:23.880 --> 38:27.000
Apologize! Say sorry!

38:27.040 --> 38:27.800
Shut up.

38:27.880 --> 38:29.600
Say sorry! Apologize!

38:29.600 --> 38:30.160
Come with me.

38:30.240 --> 38:35.040
Apologize! Say sorry!

38:59.600 --> 39:00.480
What happened to Qing Ye?

39:00.680 --> 39:01.120
Xing Wu.

39:01.240 --> 39:01.960
Where are you going?

39:24.000 --> 39:25.160
That's too much.

39:25.760 --> 39:27.320
Too much?

39:27.480 --> 39:28.320
The teacher is here.

39:28.320 --> 39:29.920
Who bullies people like that?

39:30.240 --> 39:31.520
Bullying people?

39:38.240 --> 39:38.920
What are you doing?

39:42.840 --> 39:43.440
It's the cafeteria.

39:43.440 --> 39:44.240
It's for eating.

39:45.840 --> 39:47.120
Let me remind you.

39:48.400 --> 39:49.840
Each of you

39:49.840 --> 39:50.440
only gets

39:50.440 --> 39:51.880
one shot at high school.

39:53.400 --> 39:55.000
Don't do something

39:55.000 --> 39:56.320
you'll still regret

39:57.040 --> 39:58.000
years after graduation.

40:38.920 --> 40:39.680
I'll pack it for you.

41:27.320 --> 41:27.840
Hungry?

41:29.320 --> 41:29.880
Try it.

41:30.760 --> 41:31.480
What is this?

41:32.120 --> 41:33.440
Seaweed jelly.

41:33.960 --> 41:34.840
A local specialty.

41:37.400 --> 41:37.960
Go on. Eat.

41:38.280 --> 41:38.800
It's not poisoned.

41:49.480 --> 41:50.160
It's salty.

41:51.800 --> 41:52.400
Good, right?

41:59.320 --> 42:00.480
Weren't you going with Shu Han

42:00.480 --> 42:01.480
to meet Mr. Ye?

42:02.200 --> 42:03.000
Why are you here?

42:04.320 --> 42:05.080
What a coincidence.

42:05.880 --> 42:06.640
Just passing by.

42:14.120 --> 42:16.080
Wu, emergency.

42:16.280 --> 42:17.200
Qing Ye's in trouble.

42:17.400 --> 42:18.040
Qing Ye,

42:18.160 --> 42:19.040
You stained

42:19.040 --> 42:19.880
Li Wenhui's clothes.

42:19.880 --> 42:20.640
I have to go.

42:21.040 --> 42:21.760
Something urgent.

42:23.000 --> 42:24.240
What about Mr. Ye?

42:24.320 --> 42:25.040
You know this chance

42:25.040 --> 42:25.840
is rare.

42:26.080 --> 42:27.240
Please apologize to him for me.

42:27.400 --> 42:28.400
I'll make it up next time.

42:28.600 --> 42:29.160
Xing Wu.

42:32.720 --> 42:33.720
I thought

42:35.800 --> 42:36.880
once I got to Zhazhating,

42:37.840 --> 42:39.480
everything would be over.

42:40.760 --> 42:42.120
I could start over.

42:48.160 --> 42:49.160
This is a small place.

42:50.200 --> 42:51.240
The tiniest thing

42:51.600 --> 42:53.240
spreads through town fast.

42:53.840 --> 42:55.320
People don't have much to do.

42:55.960 --> 42:56.960
They love watching drama.

42:57.680 --> 42:58.360
They hear a story,

42:58.600 --> 42:59.840
spice it up,

43:00.040 --> 43:01.040
make things up,

43:01.040 --> 43:02.280
then pass lies off as truth.

43:03.040 --> 43:04.600
The stranger, the better.

43:05.040 --> 43:05.640
Exactly.

43:06.440 --> 43:07.680
They don't care about the truth.

43:08.680 --> 43:09.640
But they forget fast.

43:10.040 --> 43:11.600
A few days later, new gossip comes,

43:11.880 --> 43:13.680
and the old story is gone.

43:15.080 --> 43:15.920
Don't take it to heart.

43:17.040 --> 43:18.080
People who spread rumors forget.

43:18.600 --> 43:19.960
But the people they hurt?

43:20.920 --> 43:22.160
What about their pain?

43:30.080 --> 43:30.880
What are you doing?

43:31.920 --> 43:32.600
Close your eyes.

43:33.240 --> 43:33.960
Close your eyes.

43:43.680 --> 43:44.440
Take a deep breath.
